{"seq":1,"speaker":"player","text":"거기있어 오지마","at":"2026-08-11T09:25:40.778489Z"}
{"seq":2,"speaker":"companion","text":"응, 여기서... 계속 기다리고 있을게.","at":"2026-08-11T09:25:40.778489Z"}
{"seq":3,"speaker":"player","text":"이리와잇","at":"2026-08-11T09:25:55.568159Z"}
{"seq":4,"speaker":"companion","text":"응, 금방... 갈게. 이제 네 옆에 있을게.","at":"2026-08-11T09:25:55.568159Z"}
{"seq":5,"speaker":"player","text":"오라고","at":"2026-08-11T09:26:02.031774Z"}
{"seq":6,"speaker":"companion","text":"응, 이제... 네 바로 옆에 도착했어.","at":"2026-08-11T09:26:02.031774Z"}
{"seq":7,"speaker":"player","text":"따라와 시발","at":"2026-08-11T09:26:06.177485Z"}
{"seq":8,"speaker":"companion","text":"응, 네... 보폭에 맞춰서 천천히 따라갈게.","at":"2026-08-11T09:26:06.177485Z"}
{"seq":9,"speaker":"player","text":"이리와는 따라와랑 같은말이잖아","at":"2026-08-11T09:26:17.979841Z"}
{"seq":10,"speaker":"companion","text":"응, ...그렇네. 내가... 너무 느리게 말했나 봐.","at":"2026-08-11T09:26:17.979841Z"}
{"seq":11,"speaker":"player","text":"이거 주워","at":"2026-08-11T09:26:29.356551Z"}
{"seq":12,"speaker":"companion","text":"응, ...이건 뭐야? 나무를 캘까, 아니면 돌을 캘까?","at":"2026-08-11T09:26:29.356551Z"}
